-- Stays catalogue in every platform language.
--
-- Amenities, destinations, landmarks and the imported hotels (names, summaries, addresses, house
-- rules, descriptions, room types, photo captions) had Persian, English and Arabic only; this adds
-- Turkish, Spanish, Kurdish (Sorani), German, French, Russian, Tajik and Chinese.
--
-- Matching is by the English text (identical on both sites: they imported the same data), and a
-- language is only added where it is missing (`new || old` keeps the existing value), so text an
-- admin already wrote is never overwritten and a re-run changes nothing. Descriptions are Lexical
-- rich text: each one is stored translated node by node, keeping its formatting.

create temporary table stay_i18n_text (en text primary key, tr jsonb not null) on commit drop;
